?$" 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426755 1072 #uuid "06d7e42a-14b7-5ba4-9656-a3c1d06d273b" 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426755 1074 "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x+0y-z=0 \\\\ x+y+3z=2 \\\\ 3x-2y+z=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=3,\\,b=-1,\\,c=2.$" 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426756 1068 #edb/ref 17592186426745 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426756 1068 #edb/ref 17592186426752 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426756 1068 #edb/ref 17592186426753 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426756 1068 #edb/ref 17592186426754 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426756 1069 "q-317636" 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426756 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426756 1071 "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}2z+3x-5=4 \\\\ 6z-4y+3=15 \\\\ 7y+2x-2=11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $3$ | $0$ | {{field-1}} |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | {{field-2}} |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} | $-4$ | $6$ |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | $12$ |  | . |\n|  |  | $2$ | {{field-4}} | $0$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | $13$ |  |  |" 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426756 1072 #uuid "5bfaecd0-980e-55a7-befc-289a7a9c5c34" 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426756 1074 "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}3x+0y+2z=9 \\\\ 0x-4y+6z=12 \\\\ 2x+7y+0z=13\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 7 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}9 \\\\ 12 \\\\ 13\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 7 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}9 \\\\ 12 \\\\ 13\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426757 1068 #edb/ref 17592186426746 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426757 1068 #edb/ref 17592186426747 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426757 1068 #edb/ref 17592186426749 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426757 1068 #edb/ref 17592186426750 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426757 1069 "q-317519" 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426757 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426757 1071 "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{\\begin{aligned}8y+6x-3z+4=0 \\\\ 5z-3y+x-6=0 \\\\ 7x-4z-y-9=0\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} | $8$ | $-3$ |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | $-4$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $1$ | $-3$ | {{field-2}} |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | {{field-3}} |  | . |\n|  |  | {{field-4}} | $-1$ | $-4$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | $9$ |  |  |" 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426757 1072 #uuid "87b42522-bb27-5dd3-ac3e-bd3279e82fdf" 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426757 1074 "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}6x+8y-3z=-4 \\\\ x-3y+5z=6 \\\\ 7x-y-4z=9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}6 & 8 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 7 & -1 & -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & 8 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 7 & -1 & -4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426758 1068 #edb/ref 17592186426751 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426758 1069 "q-36179" 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426758 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426758 1071 "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x+5z=5 \\\\ -x+5y-3z=2 \\\\ x-4y+7z=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & a & 5 \\\\ b & 5 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 7\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}c \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426758 1072 #uuid "da13acd8-77ae-5f2b-ba9c-504353353d52" 13194139534588 17592186045417 true] [17592186426758 1074 "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x+0y+5z=5 \\\\ -x+5y-3z=2 \\\\ x-4y+7z=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 5 \\\\ -1 & 5 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 7\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 5 \\\\ -1 & 5 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 7\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=0,\\,b=-1,\\,c=5.$" 13194139534588 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-01601b6f-c05d-574c-9a4a-d776d7830de4" 17592186426727 "answer-0e1d1b7d-645c-539e-8352-b3dfb9ffcd03" 17592186426728 "answer-11aba24b-9268-590e-8810-5c57e7e3c410" 17592186426729 "answer-1b7db70e-4c06-5847-ae4c-8d2d12c80e8b" 17592186426730 "answer-223847b6-00fc-5235-8827-7e678d11053d" 17592186426731 "answer-4d9e88a0-7c5e-5e8c-9e9a-14296af074a8" 17592186426732 "answer-62f10e81-bf0b-5d8f-abd5-66b9009b22b7" 17592186426733 "answer-8600538f-009c-502c-8f93-c0f999bc2b02" 17592186426734 "answer-a3f35897-b61a-57d6-81d6-9ea4cf4754e2" 17592186426735 "answer-ca5cbda7-94a5-56d2-8e39-bf95cd46be03" 17592186426736 "answer-ccaa4421-7462-521e-bd86-4c7357d0d8ca" 17592186426737 "answer-d3575d9f-b5c1-5e4f-8e61-3fb7541222f0" 17592186426738 "answer-df865a24-76e9-5e0c-aef0-ccb73198892d" 17592186426739 "answer-e1bb35e7-e173-5077-9b70-1eca4b1960a8" 17592186426740 "answer-eefcde1b-d3b8-55ec-9bff-1b6b1e19f657" 17592186426741 "answer-f375eeb9-cae0-5b47-8162-0ab390a8e5ce" 17592186426742 "answer-f600605e-c432-5a49-8937-87085525ad30" 17592186426743 "answer-fc3f9e0f-2358-5b78-8d1f-f66161800384" 17592186426744 "answer-field-28353e39-acc8-5471-9aa6-69d0698d44c5" 17592186426745 "answer-field-3858435e-6d82-5994-86f0-620119922670" 17592186426746 "answer-field-3dca1250-a568-5b14-aa99-ede3c01994fe" 17592186